# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make check` in an --enable-asan build,
# used through LSAN_OPTIONS in tests/Makefile.am.
#
# check_charset() strdup()s a charset name into source_csname or dest_csname
# without freeing the previous value (which may be a string literal, or still
# referenced by locale_charset in confutil.c). This loses a few bytes once per
# -s/-d option. See "Fix the charset name leak in check_charset()" in TODO.md.
leak:check_charset
